+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+This project has no recorded decision governing TLS certificate verification in development builds. A search of the repository's documentation, ADRs, and policy files turned up no current statement on the matter; the `InsecureSkipVerify: true` usages found in the test suite are test-client scaffolding for self-signed test certificates, not a recorded project policy.
